 ["Stages: latent → proteinuric → nephrotic → azotemic", "In the nephrotic stage there is a “large white (lardaceous) amyloid kidney”", "Finally an “amyloid contracted kidney” develops", "Chronic renal failure is the most common cause of death in amyloidosis", "Amyloid accumulates only inside tubular epithelium", "The kidney is never affected in AL amyloidosis", "In the nephrotic stage the kidney is small and granular", "The main cause of death is liver failure"],
